OL,3,GNEWSAFear and fallout three months on
OL,4,Afrom Northern Ireland's race riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaylight is still extending across the
OL,7,Fsummer evening sky over Belfast when
OL,8,FMaria looks out the window of the house
OL,9,Fshe shares with her two teenage
OL,10,Fdaughters and sees people across the
OL,11,Froad putting on balaclavas.
OL,13,FIt is Tuesday 9 June and parts of
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland are engulfed in
OL,15,Fviolence.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
