OL,3,GNEWSAFear and fallout three months on
OL,4,Afrom Northern Ireland's race riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuses are being hijacked and set on
OL,7,Ffire, with water cannon deployed by
OL,8,Fpolice to quell rioters, and people
OL,9,Ftargeted because of the colour of their
OL,10,Fskin ` these scenes will all be
OL,11,Fbroadcast around the world over the
OL,12,Fnext 48 hours.
OL,14,FMaria has lived peacefully in her home
OL,15,Fin a loyalist area of east Belfast for
OL,16,Ftwo years. Until now.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
